      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.167,
          "end": 3.81,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] So let's now start setting up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.81,
          "end": 7.23,
          "en": "our navigation configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.23,
          "end": 9.96,
          "en": "And I will do this in App.js as I did it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.96,
          "end": 11.4,
          "en": "You don't have to do it in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.4,
          "end": 13.4,
          "en": "you could do it all in a separate file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 16.13,
          "en": "and just import your configuration set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.13,
          "end": 19.69,
          "en": "your configuration component into App.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.69,
          "end": 22.82,
          "en": "But I like to set up my navigation code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.82,
          "end": 25.03,
          "en": "I will start by deleting the styles and App.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.03,
          "end": 26.86,
          "en": "we don't need them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.86,
          "end": 29.683,
          "en": "I will also delete all that content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.58,
          "end": 31.86,
          "en": "Actually, not the status part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.86,
          "end": 34.46,
          "en": "but view and text because we don't need that either.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.59,
          "end": 37.82,
          "en": "We can therefore get rid of these imports here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.82,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "from react-native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 41.85,
          "en": "And I will then add this fragment here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.85,
          "end": 44.87,
          "en": "this fragment tag to wrap it around StatusBar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.87,
          "end": 47.06,
          "en": "because below my StatusBar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.06,
          "end": 50.013,
          "en": "I now wanna set up my navigation configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.1,
          "end": 53.44,
          "en": "And for this, just as we learned it before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.44,
          "end": 58.07,
          "en": "we need to import something from @react-navigation/native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.07,
          "end": 62.18,
          "en": "and that something is the NavigationContainer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.18,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "This is a component that must be wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 69.71000000000001,
          "en": "around all your other navigation related components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.71000000000001,
          "end": 71.5,
          "en": "or all the other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.5,
          "end": 74.21000000000001,
          "en": "coming from the React Navigation packages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.21000000000001,
          "end": 78.22,
          "en": "that deal with setting up your screen structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.22,
          "end": 80.633,
          "en": "and your navigation structure overall.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.82,
          "end": 83.88,
          "en": "So therefore, we can create a opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.88,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "and closing NavigationContainer here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 88.85300000000001,
          "en": "next to the StatusBar in our app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.01,
          "end": 92.85300000000001,
          "en": "And we can now start setting up our navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.86,
          "end": 95.38,
          "en": "Now for this, I wanna create a stack",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.38,
          "end": 97.4,
          "en": "and a bottom tabs navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.4,
          "end": 100.75,
          "en": "And therefore, we need to import from these two packages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.75,
          "end": 104.35,
          "en": "We need to import from @react-navigation/native-stack",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.35,
          "end": 106.15,
          "en": "for the stack navigator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.15,
          "end": 109.53,
          "en": "and we need to import from @react-navigation/bottom-tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.53,
          "end": 111.563,
          "en": "for the bottom tabs navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.74000000000001,
          "end": 114.66,
          "en": "Now, from the native stack package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 118.023,
          "en": "we can import the createNativeStackNavigator function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.28,
          "end": 121.36,
          "en": "And from the bottom tabs package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.36,
          "end": 125.143,
          "en": "we can import the createBottomTabNavigator function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 128.77,
          "en": "And then here we can create a stack constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.77,
          "end": 129.99,
          "en": "which holds the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 129.99,
          "end": 131.89,
          "en": "of calling createNativeStackNavigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.51,
          "end": 136.15,
          "en": "And as you learned before in an earlier module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.15,
          "end": 139.57999999999998,
          "en": "this stack constant will hold an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.57999999999998,
          "end": 142.78,
          "en": "that gives us access to two components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.78,
          "end": 144.6,
          "en": "the navigator component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.6,
          "end": 147.653,
          "en": "and a component for registering screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.66,
          "end": 151.67000000000002,
          "en": "And we'll do the same thing here for the bottom tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.67000000000002,
          "end": 153.47,
          "en": "by calling createBottomTabNavigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.44,
          "end": 160.01,
          "en": "Now, then we can set up our navigation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.01,
          "end": 163.07,
          "en": "and we wanna work with nested navigators here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.07,
          "end": 166.23,
          "en": "since we have two navigators, stack and bottom tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.23,
          "end": 167.973,
          "en": "that will need to work together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.22,
          "end": 170.51,
          "en": "Now, when it comes to nesting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.51,
          "end": 173.03,
          "en": "there are always different approaches you can find,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.03,
          "end": 176.45,
          "en": "and it depends on the desired end result you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.45,
          "end": 179.54,
          "en": "But I want to make sure that I, in the end, have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.54,
          "end": 181.76,
          "en": "this ManageExpense screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.76,
          "end": 184.54,
          "en": "which allows us to edit or add expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.42,
          "end": 189.71,
          "en": "which is reachable from everywhere in this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.71,
          "end": 191.84,
          "en": "And if we are on that screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.84,
          "end": 194.883,
          "en": "then I don't wanna see the tabs at the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.72,
          "end": 198.24,
          "en": "On the other hand, I wanna have tabs at the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.24,
          "end": 200.55,
          "en": "that allow me to switch between all expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 201.853,
          "en": "and recent expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.8,
          "end": 204.66,
          "en": "And therefore, the setup I choose here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.66,
          "end": 206.85,
          "en": "is that I will use the Stack.Navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.85,
          "end": 211.1,
          "en": "as a main root navigator here, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.1,
          "end": 214.86,
          "en": "and I will add two Screens to this stack navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 214.86,
          "end": 217.76,
          "en": "One screen is the ManageExpense screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 217.76,
          "end": 221.22,
          "en": "and the other screen is a nested navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.22,
          "end": 223.31,
          "en": "that will be based on the bottom tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.31,
          "end": 226.32999999999998,
          "en": "that will be responsible for allowing us to switch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.32999999999998,
          "end": 228.59300000000002,
          "en": "between all and recent expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 230.17000000000002,
          "end": 233.683,
          "en": "Therefore, we can add our Stack.Screen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.8,
          "end": 237.2,
          "en": "And the first screen all register here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.2,
          "end": 239.44,
          "en": "is this ManageExpense screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.44,
          "end": 243.593,
          "en": "which allows us to edit, or delete, or add expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.86,
          "end": 246.71,
          "en": "And the component that should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 246.71,
          "end": 249.02,
          "en": "if we navigate to that screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.02,
          "end": 253.28,
          "en": "should be the ManageExpense component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.28,
          "end": 256.21,
          "en": "Hence we must add a import to that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.21,
          "end": 257.853,
          "en": "and then point at it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 259.27,
          "end": 262.06,
          "en": "Now the other screen I wanna register here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.06,
          "end": 265.863,
          "en": "in the Stack.Navigator is this nested bottom tabs navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.863,
          "end": 270.177,
          "en": "Therefore, I will, first of all, create another component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.177,
          "end": 273.79,
          "en": "And we could create that component in a separate file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.79,
          "end": 274.83,
          "en": "but I'll keep it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.83,
          "end": 277.69,
          "en": "to have all my navigation set up in this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.69,
          "end": 280.21,
          "en": "which is not a must to do, as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 280.21,
          "end": 282.14300000000003,
          "en": "just something I like to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.29,
          "end": 286.18,
          "en": "And I will name this component ExpensesOverview.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 286.18,
          "end": 288.203,
          "en": "Though, the name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 289.177,
          "end": 293.03,
          "en": "And then there, I will return my bottom tabs setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 293.03,
          "end": 295.93,
          "en": "So we create our BottomTabs.Navigator here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 295.93,
          "end": 298.92,
          "en": "and then we register the different screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 298.92,
          "end": 300.993,
          "en": "that we want to have in that navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 302.61,
          "end": 304.05,
          "en": "So for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.05,
          "end": 306.73,
          "en": "the first screen that I want to register here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.73,
          "end": 310.683,
          "en": "is my screen that should show the recent expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 311.65,
          "end": 315.523,
          "en": "Hence I'll give it a name of RecentExpenses, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.46,
          "end": 319.87,
          "en": "And then the component that should be loaded here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 319.87,
          "end": 323.05,
          "en": "is of course the RecentExpenses component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 323.05,
          "end": 324.66,
          "en": "which also must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.66,
          "end": 326.89300000000003,
          "en": "from the appropriate component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.85,
          "end": 330.11,
          "en": "Now, that's the first screen we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.11,
          "end": 333.04,
          "en": "The second screen I want to have in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 333.04,
          "end": 336.74,
          "en": "and which is therefore registered with BottomTabs.Screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.74,
          "end": 339.53,
          "en": "is the AllExpenses screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 339.53,
          "end": 341.07,
          "en": "And as you can guess,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.07,
          "end": 344.5,
          "en": "here we wanna point at the AllExpenses component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.5,
          "end": 345.783,
          "en": "which must be imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 347.42,
          "end": 350.43,
          "en": "So that's the core setup for the ExpensesOverview",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 350.43,
          "end": 353.24,
          "en": "which will become come our nested navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 353.24,
          "end": 356.57,
          "en": "Hence I will use ExpensesOverview as a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 356.57,
          "end": 359.783,
          "en": "that should be loaded for my second stack screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 360.73,
          "end": 362.55,
          "en": "So here in the Stack.Navigator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 362.55,
          "end": 367.55,
          "en": "in this root app component, we add another screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 367.86,
          "end": 369.86,
          "en": "The name here could be ExpensesOverview.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 371.35,
          "end": 372.73,
          "en": "And the component that we load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 372.73,
          "end": 376.05,
          "en": "is that component that sets up the BottomTabs.Navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 376.05,
          "end": 378.82,
          "en": "And therefore, we actually then have the choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378.82,
          "end": 381.683,
          "en": "between two components thanks to the bottom tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 382.74,
          "end": 385.77,
          "en": "So here I'll point at the ExpensesOverview component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 385.77,
          "end": 387.453,
          "en": "we created a second ago.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 388.91,
          "end": 389.89,
          "en": "Now, what I will do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 389.89,
          "end": 392.73,
          "en": "is I will switch the order of these two screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 392.73,
          "end": 396.21,
          "en": "because the top most screen that you register",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 396.21,
          "end": 399.07,
          "en": "in the Stack.Navigator will be the first screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 399.07,
